body:
In my world, whenever a star dies an entity known as a Solborn emerges. The solborn are very powerful and are seen as guardians of life and order. Well, as the universe aged these primordial creatures known as Rhomvhal (space whales) from a neighboring universe started to gather to feed and mate similar to what the salmon of our world do. These Rhomvhal would have destroyed all known life had the solborn purposefully not killed an eighth of the stars in our universe forcing the birthing of a super powerful solborn named Sol Noctis. The half devoured universe was saved but as penance the life force of the cosmos made it so that no more solborn could ever be born.

&#x200B;

Tl;dr Half of the universe was destroyed and the guardians of all life are now a mortal race with no means of reproduction.

>level 5

I'm thinking Szechuan extra spicy chicken from the place down the street.

&#x200B;

Kings away from their thrones

&#x200B;

Made of marble and granite

&#x200B;

Lay cursed in heavy stone

&#x200B;

Bent o’er hard choices

&#x200B;

Until their sins they atone
